  set unless the widget asks for the full sentence.
- The declared normalizer handles only Unicode NFC, surrounding/internal
  whitespace, case, and terminal punctuation. List contractions or other
  non-trivial alternatives explicitly.

SEMANTIC VARIANT

This family is semantic variant 1 for its GrammarCell.
Fill `semantic_frame` with a concise situation summary, communicative goal,
participant labels, time anchor, main verb lemma, and optional object head.
Within one family these anchors are shared. Across semantic variants the
orchestrator will require distinct predicates and contexts, so do not reuse the
reference item wording merely because it is supplied as source evidence.

